# The tuna-os/fisherman revision this repository ships in the bootstrap image
# and runs its disk and real-install selftests against. It is the only place
# the revision is written. scripts/fisherman-rev.sh reads it.
#
# 205e07d is the squash merge of tuna-os/fisherman#70 on dev. It adds
# -O verity to the manual-layout ext4 mkfs. bootc's --composefs-backend calls
# FS_IOC_ENABLE_VERITY, and ext4 refuses that unless the feature was set at
# format time. Without it, a composefs install onto customMounts fails after
# the target is formatted.
#
# Pin a commit on dev, never a PR branch head. A squash merge leaves the head
# off dev, and deleting the branch makes it unreachable (#106).
#
# Re-pinning is a maintainer decision: it changes what is written to a user's
# disk (AGENTS.md).
205e07def4d2a99784a6c905152a9a5ac138e05a
